## Security & Correctness Notes

* **Never** grant access on `success_url` alone. Only the **webhook** (after signature verification) authorizes access. ([dev.chargily.com][3])
* Use **raw body** for HMAC; JSON middleware breaks signatures. ([dev.chargily.com][3])
* Prefer **metadata** to correlate events with your DB (subscriptionId, userId, etc.). ([dev.chargily.com][2])
* Choose appropriate **fees allocation** (`customer`/`merchant`/`split`) per your pricing. ([dev.chargily.com][2])
* In Test mode use `https://pay.chargily.net/test/api/v2`; in Live switch to `https://pay.chargily.net/api/v2`. ([dev.chargily.com][1])
* Supported payment methods include `edahabia`, `cib`, and `chargily_app` (QR flow returns `qr_code_url`). ([dev.chargily.com][2])

